        "capturedAt": "2026-11-02"
      },
      "images": [
        {
          "original": "/assets/images/ps4-bo3/daybreak.png",
          "caption": "DayBreak ZM supplied preview"
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "postTitle": "DayBreak",
          "postUrl": "https://discord.com/channels/1528329794947776572/1560054428738920561",
          "capturedAt": "2026-11-02"
        },
        {
          "postTitle": "DayBreak",
          "postUrl": "https://discord.com/channels/1528329794947776572/1566180562220351518",
          "capturedAt": "2026-11-02"
        }
      ],
      "guideBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The forum contains an original SPRX archive, a later SPRX upload, and a reply supplying a ZIP labeled CUSA02624. Match the downloaded build to its own included notes and your installed title ID."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "title": "Later upload: documented build",
          "text": "The later SPRX archive README identifies DayBreak V1.1.2 for BO3 game update 1.33. It has separate CUSA02624 and CUSA02290 folders. These notes apply to that later upload; the original archive and the separate CUSA02624 reply ZIP remain available."
        },
        {
          "type": "steps",
          "title": "PS4 setup described in the later archive",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "Choose the matching folder",
              "text": "Confirm your installed BO3 title ID and update. Use the SPRX in the folder for your own title ID."
            },
            {
              "title": "Copy and register the plugin",
              "text": "Place DayBreak.sprx in /data/GoldHEN/plugins/ and add that exact path only under the matching CUSA section in /data/GoldHEN/plugins.ini. Preserve existing entries."
            },
            {
              "title": "Restart the game",
              "text": "Restart BO3. After “Press X to start”, the archive says to choose Yes at “Would you like to load DayBreak ZM SPRX?”."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "title": "Example plugin path",
          "text": "/data/GoldHEN/plugins/DayBreak.sprx"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "title": "Check the supplied configuration",
          "text": "The README examples hardcode CUSA02290 even inside the CUSA02624 folder. Use your installed game title ID. The included INI also lists unrelated plugins; merge only your own DayBreak entry."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "title": "PS5 notes supplied by the archive",
          "text": "For a matching NexHEN setup, the README says to place DayBreak.sprx in /data/nexHEN/plugins/. Add its exact path under your installed game title ID in NexHEN’s plugins.ini. Append ?autoload=true to the path for autoload, or leave it off and use NexHEN’s Plugin Loader. Start BO3 and accept the DayBreak loading prompt. Console compatibility has not been independently verified."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "title": "Loading and troubleshooting notes",
          "text": "For NexHEN autoload, the author says the load prompt may take up to 20 seconds at the main menu. If it does not appear, check the exact plugin path, your game title/update and duplicate INI entries. The README suggests trying DayBreak by itself when another BO3 plugin is loaded."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "DayBreak SPRX creator: XeX Poiiison. These version-specific steps and controls come from the later archive’s README."
        }
      ],
      "controls": [
        {
          "input": "L1 + R1",
          "action": "Open the menu"
        },
        {
          "input": "D-pad",
          "action": "Move through options"
        },
        {
          "input": "X",
          "action": "Select"
        },
        {
          "input": "Circle",
          "action": "Go back"
        },
        {
          "input": "Left / Right",
          "action": "Change values"
        },
        {
          "input": "Hold L1, then tap R1; or L1 + Triangle",
          "action": "Open the verified-player menu"
        }
      ]
